00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,360
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) It was raining.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,700
William loves jumping in puddles.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,600
He jumped in five puddles.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,740
He was wet and dirty.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:14,900
His mom told him to change his clothes.

6
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,260
They were going to a fancy party.

7
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:22,640
He wore a nice dress shirt and slacks.

8
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:26,380
William and his mom arrived at the party.

9
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,400
The host opened the door.

10
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,380
They went inside the house.

11
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,060
The host screamed.

12
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,800
William was confused.

13
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:41,340
The host pointed at his shoes.

14
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,500
He had forgotten to change them.

15
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,100
There were dark footprints on the floor.

16
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,260
He left the party.

17
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,780
He was forced to change his shoes.
